HUMAN: Round 4 (multiplayer) analysed — dead-reckoning interpolation, server id-binding + caps, shared server core module.
FIND F10 sev=H tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html:6397-6411#"const t = 1 - Math.exp(-8 * dt)" what="remote planes lerp toward last received pos only — 12.5Hz updates + no velocity = visible stutter and 80ms+ positional lag; rubber-banding under jitter" fix="dead-reckoning: (1) buildLocalMultiplayerState (def at 6179) adds vel:{x,y,z} (plane.vel, 2-decimal rounded) and tSent; (2) on state receive stamp rec.receivedAt=performance.now() and store rec.targetVel; (3) in updateMultiplayer extrapolate: predicted = targetPos + targetVel * min((now-receivedAt)/1000, 0.35), then existing exp-smooth toward predicted; (4) hard snap if error > 80m (teleport/respawn); keep quat slerp as-is" ref=flight-sim3.html:6179#"function buildLocalMultiplayerState",flight-sim3.html:6300-6301#"rec.targetPos.set",flight-sim3.html:6402-6404#"rec.group.position.lerp" dep=-
FIND F11 sev=M tag=security at=multiplayer-server.mjs:88-97#"if (msg.type === 'state')" what="server trusts client-claimed id on every message — any socket can overwrite any player's state (impersonation) and 'state' before 'join' implicitly registers; no payload/room/player caps" fix="bind identity at join: state messages must match ws.data.id (ignore mismatches, drop the implicit room.players.set for unjoined sockets); cap raw message length 4096 bytes (drop oversized); cap players per room 16 (reject join with {type:'full'}), rooms 64; identical hardening in the duplicated ws host inside tweaks-server.mjs (same handlers at tweaks-server.mjs:42-110)" ref=multiplayer-server.mjs:73-86#"if (msg.type === 'join')",tweaks-server.mjs:42#"const rooms = new Map()" dep=-
FIND F12 sev=L tag=dedup at=tweaks-server.mjs:2#"Static file server + tweak persistence + integrated multiplayer websocket host" what="entire room/broadcast/ttl/message-handler block duplicated between multiplayer-server.mjs and tweaks-server.mjs — F11's fixes would need applying twice forever" fix="extract shared mp-core.mjs exporting {getRoom,broadcast,removeSocket,handleMessage,startTtlSweep,websocketHandlers}; both servers import it; behavior identical (verify with /health + a join/state/leave round-trip via a bun ws client script)" ref=multiplayer-server.mjs:4-49,tweaks-server.mjs:42-110 dep=F11
